{"id":"work-6355","sourceIds":{"anilist":204579,"mal":63174},"info":{"title":"Are You a Jirai Girl, Chihara-san?","originalTitle":"Jirai nan desu ka? Chihara-san","synopsis":"Kuroki, un ragazzo dall'aspetto del tutto ordinario, si trova seduto in classe accanto a Mai Chihara, una studentessa considerata una vera \"mina vagante\", imprevedibile e difficile da avvicinare. Chihara è nota per la sua pelle bianca come porcellana, occhi e labbra rossi e un'espressione spesso infelice, che alimenta voci su di lei apparentemente pericolosa. Tuttavia, Kuroki scopre pian piano che i rumors su di lei sono poco attendibili: Chihara è in realtà un po' distratta e impacciata, ama i gatti e i gyoza, e mostra una gentilezza nascosta dietro il suo aspetto misterioso.","type":"series","status":"upcoming","statusLabel":"Non rilasciato","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"08 Gennaio 2027","year":2027,"season":"Inverno 2027","studios":["SynergySP"],"genres":["Commedia","Romantico","Sentimentale"],"durationLabel":"?? min/ep","declaredEpisodeCount":null,"availableEpisodeCount":0,"rating":null,"ratingCount":null,"views":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"animeworld:img","path":"/locandine/1NVmo.jpg"},"sourceType":"Anime","tags":["Anime","Non rilasciato","2027"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[204579],"malIds":[63174],"anidbIds":[19791],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[309176],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[471946]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:204579","mal:63174"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19791","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204579","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"63174","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"309176","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471946","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19791","scope":"R","raw":"anidb:19791:R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204579","raw":"anilist:204579","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"63174","raw":"mal:63174","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"309176","scope":"s1","raw":"tmdb_show:309176:s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471946","scope":"s1","raw":"tvdb_show:471946:s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}],"sourceIds":{"anilist":204579,"mal":63174},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":309176,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/309176","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T10:04:43.044Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Are You a Landmine, Chihara-san?","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"地雷なんですか？地原さん","overview":{"value":"It's the start of a new semester, and high school junior Kuroki finds himself seated beside the girl everyone whispers about: Mai Chihara. With her gothic fashion, jet-black hair, and intense stare, Chihara is said to be a “landmine” girl or jirai-kei, the hyper-feminine, dark aesthetic often associated with yandere tendencies and unstable personalities. But when Kuroki accidentally draws Chihara's attention, he discovers she isn't nearly as unstable as people claim. Beneath the intimidating aura is a surprisingly sweet girl… if a little weird.\n\nHesitantly, Kuroki begins to learn more about Chihara and her strange quirks. Is there more to her than her volatile reputation? Or is all the dark clothing just a red flag in disguise?","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"2027-01-07","status":"In Production","mediaType":"Preparato","contentScore":82,"numberOfEpisodes":1,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Nome Originale":"地雷なんですか？地原さん","Stato":"In Produzione","Tipo":"Preparato","Lingua Originale":"Giapponese"},"keywords":["high school","romcom","romance","based on manga","subculture","anime"],"networks":[{"id":94,"name":"MBS","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RNXnyiMbjgqtPAjja13wchcrGI.png"},{"id":160,"name":"TBS","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lUACMATs6jcscXIrzNCQzbvNVN5.png"}],"socialLinks":{"twitter":"https://x.com/chihara_anime","homepage":"https://chiharasan-anime.com/"},"cast":[{"id":2206133,"name":"Sayumi Suzushiro","role":"Mai Chihara (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7wEX0bXCs2djnp0dKsCqmMKZpZV.jpg"},{"id":2534630,"name":"Kazuki Ura","role":"Kuroki (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7eUgENWREmWSMnLPUFCQhvUSpdI.jpg"},{"id":1296667,"name":"Maaya Uchida","role":"Chinatsu Iwakura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrcxZXkIgHU55dMs8C4DKkUohqJ.jpg"},{"id":144655,"name":"Tomokazu Sugita","role":"Hibiya (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg"},{"id":1241498,"name":"Daisuke Ono","role":"Kazami (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rjl28lx84JjRS0hzq3Ajvx2dhp.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Are You a Landmine, Chihara-san?","overview":"It's the start of a new semester, and high school junior Kuroki finds himself seated beside the girl everyone whispers about: Mai Chihara. With her gothic fashion, jet-black hair, and intense stare, Chihara is said to be a “landmine” girl or jirai-kei, the hyper-feminine, dark aesthetic often associated with yandere tendencies and unstable personalities. But when Kuroki accidentally draws Chihara's attention, he discovers she isn't nearly as unstable as people claim. Beneath the intimidating aura is a surprisingly sweet girl… if a little weird.\n\nHesitantly, Kuroki begins to learn more about Chihara and her strange quirks. Is there more to her than her volatile reputation? Or is all the dark clothing just a red flag in disguise?"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"春――新学期の日。\n\nクラス替えを経て、新学期の初日。\n\n隣の席は、噂の地雷系の人でした。\n\n人形のような肌に、赤らんだ目元。妙に赤い唇。\n\n常に憂いを含んだような表情。\n\n容姿の面で、いわゆる『地雷』っぽいを\n\n醸しまくっている女子生徒――地原舞。\n\n高校2年に進級した地味系男子・黒木は、\n\n危険人物と噂される地原と隣の席になる。\n\nしかし、側で見る地原は、\n\n噂とはちょっと違う女の子のようで……。\n\n予測不能な地原の言動に、翻弄されっぱなしの黒木。\n\nそして、地原の意外な一面を目の当たりにすることで、\n\n彼女のイメージが徐々に変化していく。\n\n地雷系に見えて、意外と天然でポンコツ……？\n\n猫好き……？\n\n餃子ファンのカリスマ……！？\n\n“可愛い地雷系？”と隣り合わせの\n\nドキドキスクールコメディ、スタート！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9p78tIGQHH2WrTTn6yeLAf9Y6FI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9p78tIGQHH2WrTTn6yeLAf9Y6FI.png","language":"ja","width":1500,"height":245}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","language":"ja","width":1412,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yNOY9PeRKUnUob19Ac8xWkng0SB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yNOY9PeRKUnUob19Ac8xWkng0SB.jpg","language":"xx","width":2000,"height":2635}],"backdrops":[]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9p78tIGQHH2WrTTn6yeLAf9Y6FI.png","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2027,"episodeCount":1,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/309176/season/1"}],"schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TVSeries","dateCreated":"2025-12-25T20:35:59Z","dateModified":"2026-10-15T23:33:50Z","description":"It's the start of a new semester, and high school junior Kuroki finds himself seated beside the girl everyone whispers about: Mai Chihara. With her gothic fashion, jet-black hair, and intense stare, Chihara is said to be a “landmine” girl or jirai-kei, the hyper-feminine, dark aesthetic often associated with yandere tendencies and unstable personalities. But when Kuroki accidentally draws Chihara's attention, he discovers she isn't nearly as unstable as people claim. Beneath the intimidating aura is a surprisingly sweet girl… if a little weird.\n\nHesitantly, Kuroki begins to learn more about Chihara and her strange quirks. Is there more to her than her volatile reputation? Or is all the dark clothing just a red flag in disguise?","isFamilyFriendly":true,"name":"Are You a Landmine, Chihara-san?","numberOfEpisodes":1,"url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/309176-are-you-a-jirai-girl-chihara-san","countryOfOrigin":[{"@type":"Country","name":"Giappone"}],"genre":["Animazione","Commedia"],"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg","startDate":"2027-01-07T00:00:00Z"}}},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9p78tIGQHH2WrTTn6yeLAf9Y6FI.png"},"episodes":[],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:204579","mal:63174"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19791","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204579","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"63174","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"309176","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471946","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9p78tIGQHH2WrTTn6yeLAf9Y6FI.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BA1JlWb97Bw5Rc98sRf47eZtXF.jpg"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/471946/posters/694da2ffad9ad.jpg"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/471946/posters/694d3194c6e22.jpg"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx204579-eIieS4KuQN9x.jpg"}],"background":[]},"artworkLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"tmdb":{"309176":{